# Craw Wurm (6/4, no trample) is gang-blocked by Devoted Hero (1/2) and
# Silvercoat Lion (2/2). The attacking player assigns exactly lethal to each
# (2 + 2) and leaves the remaining 2 unassigned -- CR 510.1c's own decision,
# AssignCombatDamage -- which is simply wasted, no trample to carry it
# further (unlike combat-trample-excess-to-player). Both blockers still deal
# their own full power back to the Wurm (1 + 2 = 3, survives at 4 toughness).
startturn human
advance 5
queue attackers 1
declareattackers
advance
queue blocks 2=1,3=1
declareblockers
advance
advance
queue damage 2=2,3=2
combatdamage
# One more advance for the state-based-action check that moves both
# lethally damaged blockers to the graveyard.
advance
